# shanisarf: third-party notices

Every upstream input to shanisarf is listed here with its license and the
obligation shanisarf carries. Add a row before the input enters the repository
or the build (`CONTRIBUTING.md`). Code inputs are MIT only.
Data inputs are public domain, CC0 or CC BY when committed or packaged;
CC BY-SA inputs may appear here only as consulted-and-cited sources or as
lists fetched into the git-ignored `data/` for local tests, never as the
origin of a committed file.

